   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "This scene takes place outside restaurant Claude Monet in the third episode. A stern prosecutor named Vadim confronts Max and demands to know who Vika is dating. Listen to their tense conversation in Russian first, and then we will break it down together.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "Слышь, малой, есть разговор.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Что вам нужно?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "Тут у вас работает Вика.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "Виктория Сергеевна.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "С кем она тут встречается?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "Ну, почему молчим?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Почему я должен отвечать?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "Не хочешь отвечать здесь?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "Ответишь у меня в прокуратуре.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "Ты меня понял?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Понял, всё понял.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Она ни с кем не встречается.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "Ну, смотри у меня.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Надо срочно предупредить всех.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let's examine this threatening interrogation step by step.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "Слышь, малой, есть разговор.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Listen, kid, I want to talk.' A gruff stranger corners Max outside the restaurant.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Что вам нужно?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What do you need?' Max responds cautiously to the aggressive tone.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "Тут у вас работает Вика.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Vika works here with you.' The stranger names art director Vika.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "Виктория Сергеевна.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Viktoria Sergeyevna.' Adding her formal patronymic to show authority.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "С кем она тут встречается?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Who is she seeing here?' Demanding to know about her romantic life.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "Ну, почему молчим?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Well, why are we silent?' Pressuring him to answer immediately.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Почему я должен отвечать?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Why should I answer?' Max tries to stand his ground.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "Не хочешь отвечать здесь?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Don't want to answer here?' The stranger issues an ominous threat.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "Ответишь у меня в прокуратуре.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You'll answer in my prosecutor's office.' Revealing his powerful law-enforcement background.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "Ты меня понял?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Did you understand me?' Making sure the threat landed.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Понял, всё понял.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Understood, understood everything.' Backing down quickly in the face of serious trouble.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Она ни с кем не встречается.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'She is not seeing anyone.' Max protects Vika and himself with a firm denial.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "vadim",
   "t": "Ну, смотри у меня.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Well, you watch yourself.' A parting warning to keep quiet.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Надо срочно предупредить всех.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Must urgently warn everyone.' Realizing the immense danger of the situation. Alright, let's hear the whole dialogue once more.",
